    {
      "source": "Encode a stream of Objects of type <code>T</code> into a <a href=\"../io/buffer/DataBuffer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBuffer</code></a>\noutput stream.",
      "translation": "将类型为 `<code>T</code>` 的对象流编码到 `<a href=\"../io/buffer/DataBuffer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBuffer</code></a>` 输出流中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the encoder supports the given source element type and the MIME\ntype for the output stream.",
      "translation": "编码器是否支持给定的源元素类型以及输出流的 MIME 类型。",
      "count": 2
