      "source": "<code><a href=\"Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\">canEncode</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"Encoder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.codec\">Encoder</a>&lt;io.netty.buffer.ByteBuf&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\">canEncode</a></code>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"Encoder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.codec\">Encoder</a>&lt;io.netty.buffer.ByteBuf&gt;</code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"AbstractEncoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\">canEncode</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"AbstractEncoder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.codec\">AbstractEncoder</a>&lt;io.netty.buffer.ByteBuf&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"AbstractEncoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\">canEncode</a></code>` 在类 `<code><a href=\"AbstractEncoder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.codec\">AbstractEncoder</a>&lt;io.netty.buffer.ByteBuf&gt;</code>` 中",
