    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - the type of elements in the source stream",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> - 源流中元素的类型",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mimeType</code> - the MIME type for the output content (optional)",
      "translation": "<code>mimeType</code> - 输出内容的 MIME 类型（可选）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>hints</code> - additional information about how to encode",
      "translation": "<code>hints</code> - 关于如何编码的附加信息",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>byteBuf</code> - the value to be encoded",
      "translation": "<code>byteBuf</code> - 要编码的值",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this method raises <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>\nand it is expected that some encoders cannot produce a single buffer or\ncannot do so synchronously (for example, encoding a <code>Resource</code>).",
      "translation": "默认情况下，此方法会抛出<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>，并且预期某些编码器无法生成单个缓冲区或无法同步完成（例如，编码一个<code>Resource</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
