    {
      "source": "Encoder for <code>ByteBufs</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>ByteBufs</code> 的编码器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Encode an Object of type T to a data buffer.",
      "translation": "将类型为 T 的对象编码到数据缓冲区中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>elementType</code> - the expected type of elements in the input stream;\nthis type must have been previously passed to the <a href=\"Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>Encoder.canEncode(ResolvableType, MimeType)</code></a>\nmethod and it must have returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>elementType</code> - 输入流中元素的预期类型；此类型必须已先前传递给<a href=\"Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>Encoder.canEncode(ResolvableType, MimeType)</code></a>方法，且该方法必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mimeType</code> - the MIME type for the output stream\n(can be <code>null</code> if not specified)",
      "translation": "<code>mimeType</code> - 输出流的 MIME 类型（如果未指定，可以为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if supported, <code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "如果支持则为<code>true</code>，否则为<code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>inputStream</code> - the input stream of Objects to encode. If the input should be\nencoded as a single value rather than as a stream of elements, an instance of\n<code>Mono</code> should be used.",
      "translation": "`inputStream` - 要编码的对象输入流。如果输入应作为单个值而非元素流进行编码，则应使用 `Mono` 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>bufferFactory</code> - for creating output stream <code>DataBuffer</code>'s",
      "translation": "<code>bufferFactory</code> - 用于创建输出流 <code>DataBuffer</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>bufferFactory</code> - for creating the output <code>DataBuffer</code>",
      "translation": "<code>bufferFactory</code> - 用于创建输出 <code>DataBuffer</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>valueType</code> - the type for the value being encoded",
      "translation": "<code>valueType</code> - 正在编码的值的类型",
